3617475,-0.021762969,0.027032526,-0.010881239,0.09469314,-0.0043221945,0.004421395,-0.048255615,0.039012186,0.039001264,-0.018655617,-0.066176444,-0.018697046,0.010168871],"hash":"61e57154:2145","model":"nomic-embed-text:latest","archived":true},{"uri":"file:///f%3A/blackrockmu/.novamind/memory/session-log.md","text":"## 2026-11-16T12:08:26.224Z\n- **User:** [2026-11-16 04:01:41] [PACKETSNIFFER] recv() ret=80 socket=1644 [2026-11-16 04:01:41] [PACKETSNIFFER] SEND C1 5 bytes [C1 05 18 E5 87 ] [2026-11-16 04:01:41] [PACKETSNIFFER] SEND stack: Main.dll+0xBB3DE main.exe+0x5153 main.exe+0x4DD6 main.exe+0x4D9A main.exe+0x1B6780 main.exe+0xD957C Main.dll+0x1AD16 main.exe+0xDADA9 main.exe+0xD34A4 main.exe+0x5DB688 KERNEL32.DLL+0x1FCC9 ntdll.dll+0x682AE ntdll.dll+0x6827E [2026-11-16 04:01:42] [PACKETSNIFFER] SEND C1 8 bytes [C1 08 F3 FC E5 C6 03 A0 ] [2026-1…\n- **Outcome:** Achei **outro bug meu, na mesma linha**: o `LogRaw` já entrega o buffer **decifrado**, mas o consumidor aplicava `FullDecrypt` **de novo**. Com o flag `false` de antes isso nunca rodava (por isso os parses nuncaodgavam); corrigido o flag, a dupla decifração passou a destruir o header → o parse via de zero pacotes. ```cpp // PacketSniffer.cpp — OnReassembledPacket() - if (c->isGameServer) - MuCipher::FullDecrypt(outBuf, copyLen, c->xorKey, c->subKey); // ← 2ª decifração (lixo) ``` ## Também descobri que o servidor usa OUTRA chave SM Validei meu port Python contra um caso conhecido (C→S, checksum `calc=0x35 expected=0x35` ✓) → o port está certo, mas os C3 do **servidor** falham o checksum. Ou seja: o cliente tem **dois** objetos SimpleModulus — o Obj1 (`0x87977778`, envio) e o **Obj2** logo em seguida, com a chave de *recepção*. Implementei a busca pelo prefixo mágico `0x00D546EC` na memória (`SimpleModulusCipher::InitializeReceiveKeys/DecryptReceive`) e o `AutoPotion` tenta a chave de recepção quando a de envio falha. ## Estado | Item | Situação | |---|---| | Desencriptação S→C | ✅ (detecção por dados, não por porta) | | Parse dos pacotes S→C | ✅ (flag + decifração dupla corrigidos) | | life/mana/maxLife/maxMana | ✅ parsers `F3 E1` (calc, DWORD LE) + `C1 26/27` | | C3 do servidor (character info/inventário) | 🆕 chave de recepção (Obj2) — precisa de 1 teste | | Slot da potion | ⏳ learn&replay (beber 1x) ou `hpitem`/`mpitem` | ## Teste agora 1. **Reinicia o jogo** (o build mato…\n- **Tools:** edit_file, read_file, search_files, write_file, run_command, manage_todos","vector":[0.044520833,0.0424943,-0.13637632,-0.074451104,0.06926526,-0.0925763,0.02586131,0.030452698,-0.054851253,-0.056071162,-0.089057386,0.020484969,0.06176027,-0.044530503,0.031079227,-0.024271127,-0.026254762,-0.058691785,-0.041033123,-0.010970267,0.034314338,-0.02956225,-0.0014096033,-0.04337363,0.07436132,0.032986548,0.016347114,0.034444373,-0.075473726,-0.004897264,0.06928827,-0.008565517,-0.014457208,-0.056087304,-0.014884557,-0.04292654,0.013869253,-0.07733115,0.00072297186,0.024243955,0.0048107174,-0.025226306,0.019231549,-0.010372131,-0.0021569796,0.018151905,0.061685644,0.051200155,0.025980422,-0.10159491,0.033289555,0.0019086458,-0.02450536,-0.018946009,0.101244114,0.045138996,-0.049877085,0.047251426,0.02389762,-0.021931665,0.10404879,0.016901398,-0.004593026,0.05968651,0.0052927826,0.029475419,-0.04971449,0.042075716,-0.018007992,-0.0003677407,0.048255414,-0.029030696,0.0030655721,0.0055716364,0.013513809,0.029701164,-0.046777636,-0.057970073,0.00948466,0.005598284,-0.014956081,0.0060282564,0.024838936,-0.043786217,0.030269675,-0.0079037715,-0.031522095,0.034078807,-0.025993684,0.09727584,-0.017782373,-0.033920325,0.028536377,-0.027006466,-0.035594605,0.057697132,-0.037878867,0.043873314,-0.0018295889,-0.0012314874,0.004758825,-0.0040651676,0.05401027,-0.03239681,0.00045319728,0.050207626,0.040489316,0.020496465,-0.024626965,-0.0051147672,-0.01461362,0.019935168,-0.022442745,-0.04336566,0.06496198,0.005350363,0.055891015,-0.020436993,-0.0036478315,0.06654076,-0.04656712,-0.032188572,0.0531