9,-0.025777346,0.0069926525,-0.006681004,-0.037697926,-0.0016491985,-0.035031863,-0.022672275,0.003217009,0.00063870905,-0.052741263,-0.003287019,0.045666013,-0.04416256,0.03662738,0.0086114,0.047095243,-0.012611264,0.0032350582,0.004873532,0.01935306,-0.02073754,-0.03695631,-0.028044041,-0.017813826,-0.056875285,-0.012316138,0.019070353,0.027613224,-0.00293853,-0.06830943,-0.031441893,0.009127347,0.029925449,-0.016039873,-0.047311366,-0.009394398,0.014193071,-0.011755099,0.033060864,-0.010637018,0.007104216,0.0056503746,0.036865935,-0.005933571,-0.018791668,0.03913655,0.023547854,0.023237204,-0.030618833,-0.016246997,-0.021212073,-0.010328106,-0.036067422,0.03465537,-0.017503541,0.040512662,0.006475138,0.003075376,-0.06619919,-0.009317577,-0.008784985,-0.037954874,0.03953645,-0.07060046,-0.02934603,0.004555554,-0.0134562515,-0.0016519821,0.0028155828,0.008885415,0.12452635,0.007576317,-0.027252894,-0.07402617,0.03385182,0.019443672,-0.010492385,-0.018416911,-0.019764077,0.007958052],"hash":"8d1eba39:1745","model":"nomic-embed-text:latest","archived":true},{"uri":"file:///f%3A/blackrockmu/.novamind/memory/session-log.md","text":"## 2026-11-16T15:11:28.620Z\n- **User:** aparentemente funcionou. entretanto, apenas apos eu clicar em aplicar... nao deveria existir esse aplicar... se esta ativo ja era e isso... em alguns casos qd a feature nasce checked eu tbm preciso ativar e desativar ela para o byp recohecer e isso e errado\n- **Outcome:** Você tinha razão nos dois pontos — e o segundo era um bug de verdade. ## Por que só funcionava depois do \"Aplicar\" Duas causas somadas: 1. **O checkbox nasce marcado, mas o handler nunca dispara.** O `CheckedChanged` só roda em mudança de estado — no estado inicial (marcado pelo Designer) ele não dispara, então o byp **nunca recebia `POTION_START`**. Daí a necessidade de desmarcar/marcar. 2. **O byp é recarregado com o jogo.** O módulo `AutoPotion` vive na DLL do processo do jogo: quando o jogo reinicia, o byp volta do zero (config default, **desligado**), mas a UI continuava exibindo \"ligado\". Estado mentiroso. ## O que mudou **Não existe mais \"Aplicar\"** — o checkbox **é** o estado: | ação | o que sai pro byp | |---|---| | marcar o checkbox | `POTION_APPLY` (config + liga) | | desmarcar | `POTION_STOP` | | mudar HP%/MP%/intervalo | `POTION_APPLY` (debounce de 400 ms — digitar \"50\" manda **um**, não cinco) | | **byp.dll reconecta** (jogo subiu) | a UI **reaplica** o estado sozinha | | byp responde `active=0` com o checkbox marcado | a UI **reaplica** (backoff de 10 s) — o `POTION_STATE` é a fonte da verdade | **Bônus (achei no caminho):** o byp tinha um debounce de 1 s no `POTION_APPLY` que **descartava** a mensagem (pensado no repeat de teclado do botão). Isso engolia configuração legítima — mexer no limiar 2x em 1 s → a UI mostrava um valor e o módulo usava outro. Removido: agora o `POTION_APPLY` sempre aplica (`AutoPotion.cpp:825`). Arquivos: - `MainForm.cs` — `SchedulePo…\n- **Tools:** search_files, edit_file, tool_search, desktop_list_windows, desktop_screenshot, run_command, manage_todos","vector":[0.053809665,0.049597163,-0.1417748,-0.008116338,0.053890936,-0.09062918,0.083561204,0.00030421457,-0.013020206,-0.026949849,-0.040214855,0.031871412,0.09867301,0.005683136,0.0054725143,-0.014297536,-0.020270199,-0.05740015,-0.05533455,0.025635105,0.0043758936,-0.03879619,-0.022110617,-0.022269422,0.05222272,0.041243054,-0.02292291,0.069246806,-0.020316703,0.018495208,0.023301456,0.05299647,0.033123948,-0.048943818,0.051916093,-0.03862506,0.0907388,-0.019093761,0.009989226,0.01072457,-0.008250058,-0.0065874504,0.02323671,-0.004731464,0.029633047,0.039083585,0.060034316,0.045140546,0.05384106,-0.04418204,0.042578463,-0.009908861,0.035343245,-0.048304923,0.088236466,0.0656133,-0.01847207,0.061786234,0.026499795,-0.050597083,0.078087345,0.04466665,0.022717066,0.08905547,-0.0037956673,-0.012762185,-0.017191393,0.030199932,-0.03963358,0.003942117,0.0031255863,-0.028170511,0.015797136,0.0020