37,0.051057678,-0.00817151,-0.035928506,0.053321775,-0.01435549,0.037923366,-0.028298019,0.036374774,-0.014635046,0.044268824,0.06371621,0.025741363,-0.01305874,0.03261595,0.055395946,0.016962737,-0.044793103,-0.04620867,-0.050380755,-0.060927067],"hash":"e6907dbf:18","model":"nomic-embed-text:latest","archived":true},{"uri":"file:///f%3A/blackrockmu/.novamind/memory/session-log.md","text":"- **Refactor (committed):** 9 commits (`c92afdc`…`6846467`) reorganized `src/` and `src/include/` (`MuCipher`, `DebugTools`, `NameRewriter`, `PacketReassembler`, `PacketInjector`, `CommandChannel`, `PacketChannel`, `WinsockHooks`, `GameMemory`) with no behavior change.\n- **Auto-potion fixes:** `F3 10` is packet **C4** (previously ignored by `TryDecodeSmBody`); added C4 support and grew decrypt buffer 512→2048 bytes. Root UI bug was `DecodeItemId()` in `AutoPotion.cpp`: group read from bits 3..6 of byte 5, but server uses bits 4..7 — corrected and validated against `Data\\Local\\Eng\\ItemTooltip_eng.txt` (21/21 items coherent).\n- **Potion selection:** replaced ID ranges with `POTIONS[]` table (IDs/names `14,0..6`, `14,38..40`, `14,70/71`, `13,117..120`). `F3 14` = item modified, `C1 28` = item removed. `VerifyAutoUse()` detects failure in 900 ms, switches slots of same type, stops invalid injections. Commands: `POTION_START/STOP/CONFIG/STATUS`; 100 ms polling.\n- **UI/diagnostics:** `AutoPotion.cpp` → `POTION_STATE` → `Messages.cs`/`DllCommandService.cs` → `MainForm.cs` (`lblPotionState`) showing HP/MP, source, quantity, red alert. Vitals from `src/game/GameMemory/ClientVitals.cpp`; log at `F:\\blackrockmu\\gg_bypass2_s2c.log`.\n- **UI state fix (latest):** removed \"Aplicar\" button — the checkbox *is* the state. `CheckedChanged` didn't fire on Designer-initial checked state, so bypass never got `POTION_START`; now marking → `POTION_APPLY` (config + start), unmarking → `POTION_STOP`, threshold edits → `POTION_APPLY` with 400 ms debounce. On bypass reconnect (game restart) the UI re-applies; if bypass replies `active=0` while checked, UI re-applies with 10 s backoff — `POTION_STATE` is source of truth. Also removed the bypass's 1 s debounce that discarded legitimate `POTION_APPLY` (`AutoPotion.cpp:825`).\n- **Uncommitted local changes:** `SimpleModulusCipher::EncryptBlock` checksum; auto-potion C3+SM; `GameMemory::Player::UserObject()`/`Character()` failures; `src/include/SafeRead.h` using `VirtualQuery`; `PacketSniffer.cpp::LogRaw()`; `ReasmContext::isGameServer` plus viewport/skill-map restore.\n- **Confirmed protocols:** C1 26/27, C1 F3 E1, F3 E0/11/E2, C1 11; distinct SM keys send/receive; Obj1 `0x87977778`. Obj2 `0x00D546EC` untested with real C3.\n- **Open threads:** rebuild/deploy to `F:\\blackrockmu\\`; test with game stopped; confirm life/mana (`ClientVitals`,","vector":[0.038625963,-0.0017553987,-0.17007935,-0.033818714,0.088225454,-0.08667415,0.077069364,0.018865028,0.012639127,-0.05619922,-0.05353322,0.052674167,0.021434816,-0.019107996,-0.0019433907,-0.0000070333067,0.010120353,-0.039221458,-0.011753334,0.0019445502,0.024698287,-0.10306285,-0.04794452,-0.03704935,0.061918966,0.051859267,0.0023842056,0.019454587,-0.06651428,0.013652234,0.073833875,-0.043102235,0.016009102,-0.04844063,0.002320027,-0.010090215,0.061180055,0.010179526,-0.01677852,0.041967317,0.02555677,0.042519026,0.016397165,-0.042472787,-0.004910958,0.02329778,0.081922956,0.013847158,0.031456724,-0.07572829,0.053724837,-0.035594683,-0.016667632,-0.018173533,0.0287553,0.076028615,-0.038502224,0.07726125,0.022756316,-0.0543949,0.022972092,0.043248605,0.0010539887,0.038838554,0.030650474,0.03267078,-0.011836582,0.09436888,-0.018617658,0.017045084,0.009464468,-0.008825712,0.0078696245,0.0013448304,-0.016565312,0.0048526055,-0.056906782,-0.04933376,-0.0017755604,-0.0053319363,-0.03417887,-0.01669021,0.040445235,-0.023922108,0.030680936,0.019176003,-0.025086623,0.030524388,-0.04600082,0.07357582,-0.0075465958,-0.027481861,0.021056807,0.009521103,-0.06749943,0.02763935