tens (F3 10): 42 item(ns) 07:33:04 slot=22 item=0x1C03 (grupo 14, idx 3) Large Healing Potion 07:33:04 slot=30 item=0x1C06 (grupo 14, idx 6) Large Mana Potion 07:33:04 pocoes no inventario: 4 slot(s) de HP (Large Healing Potion), 1 de MP (Large Mana Potion) ``` Ou seja: **nenhum clique**, o auto-potion ligou sozinho (07:32:46, quando o byp conectou) e o decode corrigido achou **4 Large Healing Potion (slots 22/29/37/47) + 1 Large Mana Potion (slot 30)** — com o nome correto, o que prova que o ID do item agora sai certo. (E na sessão das 06:35 a mochila realmente não tinha potion nenhuma — eram 43 itens de armadura/escudo/joia; as potions apareceram depois.) ## O que mexi nesta rodada | arquivo | mudança | |---|---| | `MainForm.Designer.cs` | `btnPotionStatus` removido (declaração, `Controls.Add`, bloco de propriedades, campo) | | `MainForm.cs` | handler do botão removido | | `Services/PotionService.cs` | `RequestStatus()` removido (virou código morto) | O `POTION_STATUS` continua existindo **no protocolo do byp** (é o que eu uso pra diagnosticar pelo log) — só não tem mais …\n- **Tools:** search_files, edit_file, desktop_screenshot, desktop_list_windows","vector":[-0.002737787,0.042115968,-0.15232635,-0.030798594,0.042226933,-0.094527155,0.060026135,-0.033375774,-0.039905112,-0.012640589,-0.005874982,-0.006550072,0.054875858,-0.06432538,0.02771066,-0.028642742,-0.009442305,-0.040937223,-0.05291298,0.029675076,0.0039025908,-0.02956366,-0.064987846,0.038329564,0.057463612,0.029766612,-0.034376632,0.051429108,-0.0051795156,0.010080487,0.047616825,-0.010581838,0.019785583,-0.021927606,0.014395,-0.0359746,0.07751186,-0.0052561522,0.03427181,0.00006489063,0.0048472793,-0.053389832,0.02526812,-0.037963558,0.04749244,0.011294615,0.038272858,0.0065563363,0.036693383,-0.06978875,0.041679416,-0.0071696388,0.0040285503,-0.03339019,0.07287022,0.100964226,-0.029580904,0.015337398,0.066332564,0.012534084,0.071675435,0.016155455,-0.0014802477,0.124936976,0.013831206,-0.027082881,-0