85,-0.054215215,-0.014868077,0.037072327,0.055115633,-0.01588942,-0.060489822,-0.040435545,0.0062833787,-0.014650923,0.015899414,-0.052192423,-0.022311905,-0.01966516,0.010311816,0.032242298,-0.00362358,0.010226595,0.0012353795,0.0128085,-0.024993,-0.028337194,0.035754364,0.003912822,-0.016086567,-0.011569185,-0.008651964,-0.030325351,0.004595519,-0.03780401,0.0012857151,-0.0006051673,0.029172054,0.011589754,0.005385724,-0.044456325,-0.011814691,0.018619591,-0.04849945,0.030227013,-0.026173854,-0.040954772,0.023180995,-0.025721336,0.009737143,0.036853313,0.034081466,0.11735549,-0.017089406,0.010959292,-0.033467382,0.03736628,0.0077333013,0.020703804,-0.0074834647,-0.017923066,-0.011951623],"hash":"ffd2fff:1649","model":"nomic-embed-text:latest","archived":true},{"uri":"file:///f%3A/blackrockmu/.novamind/memory/session-log.md","text":"## 2026-11-16T15:36:17.619Z\n- **User:** arquive as changes do openspec.\n- **Outcome:** Arquivado. As 3 changes ativas foram movidas com a CLI oficial: ``` openspec list → No active changes found. openspec/changes/archive/ 2026-11-16-add-auto-potion/ (proposal + design + tasks, 19/22) 2026-11-16-auto-potion-autonomo/ (29/35) 2026-11-16-reorganize-byp-modules/ (35/44) ``` Os `.openspec.yaml`, `proposal.md`, `design.md` e `tasks.md` foram junto (o `tasks.md` do auto-potion-autonomo está com as fases 6.5–6.8 e 7.1–7.9 preenchidas). **Avisos da CLI** (não bloqueantes): todos os changes tinham tasks de **teste de campo** pendentes — 6 no `auto-potion-autonomo` (3.3 disparo após dano, 4.4 troca quando a potion acaba, 5.1–5.4 max estável), 3 no `add-auto-potion` e 9 no `reorganize-byp-modules` (smoke tests de ataque/skill). Arquivei com `--yes` porque a implementação de todas está commitada e o que falta é a tua verificação manual. **Duas observações:** 1. O `openspec/specs/auto-potion/spec.md` (3742 bytes) ficou **intacto** — os changes não tinham pasta `specs/` com deltas, então a CLI não tinha o que aplicar. Se quiser, eu atualizo o spec com o que mudou nesta rodada (decode do ID do item nos bits 4..7 do byte 5, `F3 14`/`C1 28`, tabela de potions com nome, `POTION_STATE` com `hpName/mpName`, e a regra \"o checkbox é o estado, sem botão Aplicar\"). 2. O `git status` mostra os diretórios antigos como `D` e os novos como `??` (a CLI moveu os arquivos, não usou `git mv`). Deixei **sem commit**, como sempre — é só um `git add -A openspec` + commit quando você quiser.\n- **Tools:** run_command","vector":[-0.012369796,0.027793642,-0.14630143,-0.012548643,0.06837081,-0.064433776,0.04173254,-0.008783171,-0.027304225,-0.010109199,0.011134544,0.014496255,0.087734714,-0.012922208,-0.008056634,0.02974658,-0.011968744,-0.06044643,-0.044997133,0.03809148,0.059041016,-0.06851292,-0.04313513,0.010739953,0.095033176,0.04835673,0.015747847,0.068260126,-0.021701256,0.0008698582,0.02780343,0.011176443,0.036863532,0.0013668486,0.020689595,-0.040126964,0.076719455,0.0112866415,0.0073431246,0.010432477,0.027822638,-0.0016756875,0.028696919,0.0024760738,0.020953659,-0.010057319,0.035260722,-0.01003008,0.032051418,-0.06066682,0.07115107,-0.012146721,-0.0090220105,0.0069540055,0.08551676,0.043166697,-0.0015657534,0.08531142,0.029731384,-0.045481566,0.04044949,0.017114045,0.04126528,0.083976336,-0.015226167,0.019677768,-0.022810848,0.0017182124,-0.015427828,0.0001702359,0.048047595,-0.00093280344,0.04238714,-0.014002573,0.006039445,-0.021635767,-0.04304805,-0.035284154,-0.015367986,0.011033876,0.010795973,0.025468849,0.12471004,-0.05988345,0.060055055,-0.04123744,-0.027294576,-0.0038898166,-0.03724432,0.06657509,-0.012265166,-0.00840121,0.044141546,0.01859252,-0.05660149,-0.003940709,-0.024941687,0.03115386,-0.06365041,-0.0038681184,-0.058331296,-0.018417172,0.0069846185,-0.009680974,-0.0006435268,0.03563178,-0.030086845,0.0026176285,0.022298636,0.01694739,0.012596349,0.0471563,-0.048412688,-0.038228307,0.02805756,-0.034155108,0.055262316,-0.04593348,0.052917227,0.03323499,-0.0026365852,-0.007975693,-0.011948051,0.03129381,0.05