ed-text:latest","archived":true},{"uri":"file:///f%3A/blackrockmu/.novamind/memory/session-log.md","text":"- **Refactor (committed):** 9 commits (`c92afdc`…`6846467`) reorganized `src/` and `src/include/` (`MuCipher`, `DebugTools`, `NameRewriter`, `PacketReassembler`, `PacketInjector`, `CommandChannel`, `PacketChannel`, `WinsockHooks`, `GameMemory`) with no behavior changes.\n- **Auto-potion built:** C4 (`F3 10`) item decoding, 2048-byte decrypt buffer, fixed `DecodeItemId()` (bits 4–7 of byte 5), `POTIONS[]` metadata; 21/21 items validated against `Data\\Local\\Eng\\ItemTooltip_eng.txt`. Supports `F3 14`/`C1 28`, 900 ms failure detection, same-type slot switching, and `POTION_START/STOP/CONFIG/STATUS` with 100 ms polling.\n- **Verified end-to-end:** On startup, bypass connection auto-enables auto-potion (`hp<50%`, `mp<30%`, 1000 ms); found 4 Large Healing Potions (slots 22/29/37/47) and 1 Large Mana Potion (slot 30). UI shows HP/MP, source, quantity, alerts via `POTION_STATE` (`AutoPotion.cpp` → `Messages.cs`/`DllCommandService.cs` → `MainForm.cs`/`lblPotionState`).\n- **UI cleanup:** \"Aplicar\" button and `RequestStatus()` removed; checkbox is authoritative (`CheckedChanged` → `POTION_APPLY`/`POTION_STOP`); threshold edits re-apply after 400 ms; reconnect/reapply + 10 s retry when bypass is inactive. `POTION_STATUS` remains in the bypass protocol but is log-only (`gg_bypass2.log`).\n- **Openspec archived (uncommitted):** 3 changes moved via CLI to `openspec/changes/archive/`: `2026-11-16-add-auto-potion`, `2026-11-16-auto-potion-autonomo`, `2026-11-16-reorganize-byp-modules` (with `.openspec.yaml`, proposal/design/tasks). `openspec/specs/auto-potion/spec.md` untouched (no deltas to apply) — may need manual update for new decode IDs, `F3 14`/`C1 28`, potion table, `POTION_STATE` fields, checkbox-as-state rule. `git status` shows old dirs as `D`, new as `??` (CLI moved files, no `git mv`); needs `git add -A openspec` + commit. Warnings: all changes still have pending field-test tasks (6, 3, and 9 respectively) — archived with `--yes`.\n- **Pending/uncommitted:** `SimpleModulusCipher::EncryptBlock` checksum; auto-potion C3+SM; `GameMemory::Player::UserObject()`/`Character()` failure handling; `src/include/SafeRead.h` via `VirtualQuery`; `PacketSniffer.cpp::LogRaw()`; `ReasmContext::isGameServer` + viewport/skill-map restore.\n- **Open:** Rebuild/deploy to `F:\\blackrockmu\\`; test with game stopped; verify life/mana paths (`ClientVitals`, Obj2, `XorData`); review `0x59C725`,","vector":[0.016134815,-0.009903297,-0.17403704,-0.023519775,0.064654134,-0.09613236,0.07650133,0.016386086,0.013721571,-0.054867852,-0.045136213,0.03617452,0.026366254,-0.026760941,0.009928014,-0.0053712684,0.012733052,-0.047459744,-0.0032834795,0.007479572,0.04455711,-0.10307038,-0.056670364,-0.022074394,0.07043807,0.054888025,0.005694393,0.009216577,-0.066836074,0.024442198,0.06271325,-0.054136883,0.015963819,-0.04765977,0.003420633,-0.008044893,0.0564714,0.014370703,-0.013172821,0.04461456,0.019358087,0.0404709,0.034004293,-0.045346543,0.014687578,0.026613094,0.05754167,-0.0058404636,0.03763205,-0.056182247,0.052118465,-0.0335585,-0.03146997,0.01091715,0.026054213,0.07402198,-0.031519156,0.062259626,0.031738225,-0.061575454,0.028441282,0.042997807,0.016908113,0.046005428,0.026972704,0.023534507,-0.011846354,0.08668816,0.0019001545,0.0048627816,0.012118983,-0.0069195633,0.0227565,-0.0012048404,-0.003025295,0.010656513,-0.05938129,-0.052273497,0.0133933155,-0.003910481,-0.018010644,-0.015685659,0.0707518,-0.025780357,0.026399907,0.0004990568,-0.035753816,0.0208546,-0.04150191,0.08272669,-0.0032998426,-0.011900791,0.017050913,0.003673963,-0.04842483,0.025772367,-0.023751907,-0.00286706,-0.062565066,-0.011454448,-0.004176563,-0.01990101,-0.03897041,0.037566613,0.026852267,0.054015875,-0.019339178,0.021865236,0.019510241,0.04391222,-0.011586031,-0.0029222071,-0.026137562,-0.030265512,0.072845794,-0.004016877,0.07309773,-0.010058344,0.02390919,0.03078774,0.0