,-0.046759233,0.0308758,-0.029505078,-0.016423242,-0.021980524,-0.0000484964,0.0048763016,-0.014298986,-0.031189825,0.06237861,-0.007869651,0.025094645,0.025009003,-0.0059404457,-0.0021691835,-0.00939101,0.062286694,-0.03127185,-0.07417653,-0.0025274577,-0.026577115,-0.018708078,0.032316513,0.00082050357,0.0434264,0.012992643,-0.023032201,-0.04605659,-0.03606101,0.029360412,-0.008149511,-0.048984185,-0.036730923,0.015114581,-0.021085802,-0.026136465,-0.08566362,0.021041103,-0.0022111319,0.04821053,0.030167915,0.02040759,-0.0009549835,0.019425726,0.014041723,0.0143107595,0.054421023,-0.036261026,-0.031566806,-0.00301405,-0.03805712,0.019335765,0.02206188,-0.005254064,0.10512551,0.0071172304,0.04319728,-0.029142212,0.076538175,0.012776932,-0.035702635,-0.064890705,-0.019468637,-0.039706323],"hash":"b9cf982:197","model":"nomic-embed-text:latest","archived":true},{"uri":"file:///f%3A/blackrockmu/.novamind/memory/session-log.md","text":"## 2026-11-16T16:09:43.308Z\n- **User:** /openspec:apply\n- **Outcome:** Revertido. O código voltou ao estado do seu commit (`2c1bd17`) — **nada de commit**. **O que foi desfeito** (tudo desta sessão): - `InstanceInfo.{h,cpp}` e `PlayerInfo.{h,cpp}` (byp) — apagados - `InstanceRegistry.cs` (UI) — apagado - portas por instância no `CommandChannel`/`PacketChannel`, `Config.h`, `dllmain.cpp`, `build.bat` - `PlayerMessage` + `OnPlayer` + título da janela + header + **tabela de instâncias** + botão \"Adotar jogo\" + combo de processos (`Messages.cs`, `DllCommandService.cs`, `MainForm.cs`, `MainForm.Designer.cs`) - `PlayerInfo::SetLevel` no `AutoPotion.cpp` - a pasta `F:\\blackrockmu\\instances\\` e os registros de teste **Estado agora**: `byp.dll` recompilado do source revertido e deployado; `MuProxy2` recompilado (0 warnings) e rodando de novo (PID 10788) — sem a tabela estranha, sem o \"Adotar jogo\", sem o header. `git status` só mostra os `.novamind` (automáticos) e as 3 pastas `openspec/changes/` (documentos, não código). **Sobre o \"não tá legal\"** — entendi o motivo: o HWID existe porque **o servidor não deixa mais de uma conta por PC**. Ou seja, trocar o HWID é burlar essa regra do servidor. Isso eu **não implemento** se o servidor é de terceiro (o cliente detecta HWID trocado e é ban). Se o servidor é seu, aí é outra conversa. **O que ainda está no papel** (3 documentos, só texto — nada implementado): - `hwid-viewer` — justamente o que você acabou de dizer que é \"por causa da regra de 1 conta por PC\" - `multi-instance-muproxy` — portas por instância +…\n- **Tools:** manage_todos, read_file, write_file, edit_file, search_files, desktop_list_windows, desktop_screenshot, run_command","vector":[0.029238926,0.042442914,-0.15591818,-0.030080201,0.06467888,-0.04642254,0.044855233,0.034031738,-0.050811354,-0.042593606,-0.030687949,0.010831081,0.03942453,0.0032267019,0.051413685,0.003503711,0.00859997,-0.047782958,-0.062093846,0.0124112675,0.016526667,-0.09886636,-0.042834032,0.0041845846,0.091511145,0.06381546,0.020599293,0.06498174,-0.051135078,-0.019739222,0.015942907,0.02094099,0.052038632,-0.033083286,0.022182107,-0.02596291,0.018667238,-0.03382286,-0.014073435,0.010589838,-0.013958135,-0.011302897,0.03853331,-0.03554938,0.036298387,-0.00958777,0.036583167,0.019464862,0.07390605,-0.08436495,0.06214687,-0.017788226,0.0056126183,-0.04121406,0.060680065,0.031357676,-0.0434001,0.037299506,0.027553622,-0.041105717,0.05899197,0.0385173,0.041318137,0.05506985,-0.020882472,0.00651524,-0.057331957,0.03093271,-0.012588065,-0.020169178,0.03927277,-0.0029186055,0.047585238,-0.020928983,0.013779203,-0.024801135,-0.060610116,-0.06410563,-0.030870672,-0.0020119,0.031004878,0.02632874,0.11613536,-0.019824825,0.039037425,-0.008953278,-0.033041075,-0.009401739,-0.06705976,0.055323903,-0.0038851872,-0.0047723083,0.018262116,0.01804545,-0.0483885,-0.011502464,-0.046256736,0.007515231,-0.03158964,0.013942044,-0.051999945,-0.05460486,-0.0010423849,-0.002557441,0.020288602,0.07195568,0.013799167,0.022226064,0.029921979