— módulo ASM + hook do gerador** (o que faz \"cada sessão com HWID diferente\" funcionar) | arquivo | o que faz | |---|---| | `src/hwid/HwidAsm.asm` (novo) | `HwidAsm_Address` = **slot persistente**; `SetAddress/GetAddress/ReadString/WriteString` | | `src/include/HwidAsm.h` (novo) | contrato cdecl | | `src/include/HwidManager.h` + `src/hwid/HwidManager.cpp` (novos) | resolve o endereço 1×, lê, normaliza, **hooka o gerador** | | `src/core/dllmain.cpp` | `HwidManager::Initialize()` + log do byp na pasta da sessão | O hook: em `Main.dll` RVA `0x00151AA0` o cliente faz `call [wsprintfA]` (6 bytes) → virou `call rel32` + NOP. O hook deixa o cliente gerar o valor normal e **sobrescreve o buffer** com o da instância → o cliente continua cifrando com a cifra dele e o override vale em **todo** login/reconect. **Portas por instância** (`MUPROXY_BASE`) | | byp | MuProxy2 | |---|---|---| | base | `InstancePorts::Base()` (lê `MUPROXY_BASE` no attach) | `InstanceAllocator.Allocate()` — **testa bind real** de 44411/44412/44413 | | CMD | `44412+base` | escuta em `44412+base` | | PKT | `44413+base` | escuta em `44413+base` | | login | `44411+base` (remap no hook de connect) | escuta em `44411+base` | | GS | `porta real+base` (remap no hook de connect) | escuta em `porta real+base` (via C116) | Sem race: os dois lados derivam a porta local do **mesmo** número real. E `MainForm` agora mata **só o `main.exe` que a inst…\n- **Tools:** search_files, write_file, edit_file, run_command, manage_todos","vector":[0.028181152,0.049249306,-0.17864078,-0.027373169,0.043251436,-0.04402633,0.03896823,-0.006595917,-0.0453005,-0.034894686,-0.03631052,0.022392344,0.08677026,0.0019998986,0.02542133,-0.012951827,-0.018154552,-0.068576746,-0.058629673,0.0027092164,-0.007641948,-0.054970767,-0.045154452,0.00654167,0.0974568,0.061658803,0.0075647472,0.038850617,0.0027370774,0.0015262037,0.01505954,-0.009965805,0.032567628,-0.022167915,-0.010995447,-0.03974435,0.044707086,-0.029332235,-0.0026512563,-0.0000