`, `mp<30%`, 1000 ms. State/alerts flow `AutoPotion.cpp` → `Messages.cs`/`DllCommandService.cs` → `MainForm.cs`/`lblPotionState`.\n- **HWID:** Webzen/eMU-style format, cached by `Main.dll` in `HKCU\\Software\\Webzen\\Mu\\Config\\BIN`. Login C3 (`C1 5F F1`) carries encrypted credentials plus `TickCount`, version, serial and encrypted HWID. Checksum blocks direct `Main.dll` patching; package substitution was reverted (ban/rules risk).\n\n**Key decisions**\n- Multi-instance/player-HUD prototype (`MUPROXY_BASE`, hooks/ASM, ports `44411–44413+base`) fully reverted to `2c1bd17`; no leftover tables/processes in UI.\n- `byp.dll` rebuilt and deployed; `MuProxy2` recompiled without warnings, running (PID 10788).\n\n**Current state**\n- Rebuild/deploy in `F:\\blackrockmu\\` is the immediate next step.\n\n**Open threads**\n- Crash: `NullReferenceException` at `MainForm.ShouldShowLog(String msg)` — `F:\\blackrockmu\\byp\\MuProxy2\\MuProxy2\\MainForm.cs:743` (unresolved; last turn produced only tool artifacts).\n- OpenSpec pending: `multi-instance-muproxy`, `hwid-viewer`, `dark-ui-muproxy`; manually update `openspec/specs/auto-potion/spec.md` and commit via `git add -A openspec`.\n- Tech debt: `SimpleModulusCipher::EncryptBlock` checksum, auto-potion C3+SM, `GameMemory::Player::UserObject()`/`Character()` failures, `SafeRead.h` with `VirtualQuery`, `PacketSniffer.cpp::LogRaw()`, `ReasmContext::isGameServer`, skill viewport/map restore, SM logs, skill tests, choice between `InjectSkillC1` and `InjectC1Attack` (`AttackModule.cpp:207`).","vector":[0.03461613,-0.008819581,-0.19023664,-0.042829752,0.040125944,-0.09667195,0.053782165,-0.0036113497,-0.0034790384,-0.061640847,-0.038543902,0.051432077,0.029646646,-0.019043539,0.023560341,-0.009743744,0.010236001,-0.059179015,-0.020261265,-0.010872651,0.030213011,-0.07613893,-0.024991319,-0.027461471,0.0940776,0.086083636,0.038744904,0.0068153646,-0.047004197,0.009065807,0.08378601,-0.053465568,0.018319039,-0.008726505,-0.026891118,-0.0213