0141955,-0.020249471,-0.04739778,-0.014836965,0.006993798,-0.0027345866,0.020417772,0.021694124,0.035831828,-0.006596351,0.014283901,-0.059323266,0.0030047817,-0.0064160945,-0.025692217,-0.0117601575,0.021773683,-0.051417496,0.015722701,0.009206935,0.0079387,0.028289532,-0.018312076,0.01017656,0.023982894,0.03018695,-0.012592704,-0.056819726,0.0032202452,-0.008810962,0.015297182,0.006456724,-0.030913284,0.0048634177,-0.04774845,-0.008034378,-0.046110604,-0.021180974,0.02367773,0.0011061049,-0.008630492,-0.043145332,0.0032834979,-0.05777184,-0.024713492,0.0014249126,0.03513821,-0.038861264,0.01801299,-0.0029119463,-0.003642673,-0.0038586506,-0.0050996207,-0.023018995,-0.010815511,0.025893578,-0.006394869,-0.036832243,0.053878065,0.03180142,0.016817454,-0.013999031,0.024002701,0.108968206,0.025294758,0.025584152,-0.082345895,0.03124532,0.01429566,0.008721815,-0.07012316,0.0109864175,0.01245541],"hash":"23131890:2181","model":"nomic-embed-text:latest","archived":true},{"uri":"file:///f%3A/blackrockmu/.novamind/memory/session-log.md","text":"## 2026-11-16T19:42:02.274Z\n- **User:** ta dando maincrc error, algo que tu fez cagou mt o negocio kkkkk\n- **Outcome:** Corrigido — e o culpado foi meu mesmo (a pasta de sessão). Resumo do que rolou: ## O que eu quebrei (e por quê) A pasta de sessão muda o **CWD** do cliente. E o cliente valida a integridade do próprio executável assim (confirmado no binário, `Main.dll` RVA `0x13E710`): ``` GetModuleFileNameA(0, buf) → \"F:\\blackrockmu\\main.exe\" extrai só o NOME do arquivo → \"main.exe\" abre \"main.exe\" (RELATIVO AO CWD) → não achou → MessageBox \"Main.exe CRC error!\" → ExitProcess ``` Ou seja: com o CWD em `sessions\\base100` (sem `main.exe`), o CRC quebrava. Eu já tinha criado a pasta com as **junções** (`Data`, `Scripts`), mas esqueci dos **arquivos**. ## Correção `Services/SessionFolder.cs` agora monta a sessão completa: - **hardlink** de todos os arquivos do jogo na pasta da sessão → mesmo conteúdo, **custo zero de espaço**, refeito a cada launch (acompanha update do launcher); - **junção** das pastas (`Data`, `Scripts`, …); - **cópia** do `Settings.ini` (é o que guarda `[AutoLogin] User/Password` → **conta própria por instância**); - `*.log` ficam de fora (o byp grava o log dele na pasta da sessão → cada instância com seu log). ## O que cada peça resolve | Problema | Correção | |---|---| | Cliente se fecha sozinho ao ver a janela do outro | `byp: src/client/ClientPatches.cpp` neutraliza o `FindWindowA` (RVA `0x13E6AD`) → o `ExitProcess` silencioso nunca dispara | | Servidor derruba a 2ª conta (1 conta por HWID/PC) | `byp: HwidManager::BuildPerInstanceHwid` → 4º grupo do HWID muda por base (ma…\n- **Tools:** edit_file, run_command, read_file, manage_todos","vector":[0.060903072,0.037682038,-0.14209832,-0.0071968525,0.037276607,-0.07554071,0.053477623,0.054796427,-0.07114491,-0.0393037,-0.03027079,0.02126109,0.070638075,0.013764809,0.046936277,0.0027433012,-0.024292411,-0.02771592,-0.08719234,0.02354798,-0.015192694,-0.02032617,0.021879932,-0.026630098,0.09666871,0.058690067,0.013353381,0.06288716,-0.01291889,0.032234833,0.00072017603,0.045285653,0.05358135,0.002859991,-0.032536272,-0.06480573,0.05976811,-0.03308854,-0.023307374,-0.025785586,0.0013366304,-0.031297833,0.02191375,-0.020972908,0.019783868,-0.0148937525,0.009322625,0.04256659,0.026821824,-0.07132969,0.030539941,0.007447787,0.015815625,-0.0648041,0.094424635,0.034273997,0.0069514513,0.024514146,0.036638893,-0.05557311,0.10153712,0.026662026,0.013643467,0.06482975,-0.0140599515,-0.021716561,-0.053669855,0.03591365,0.0076785837,-0.02998968,0.04074938,0.0007432607,0.052313942,-0.0011881607,-0.019071873,-0.0063501727,-0.033657767,-0.038650952,0.016399743,0.0038169164,0.008713775,-0.004235584,0.0802484,-0.025294535,0.015789188,0.017351862,-0.01587694,0.012731845,-0.04832403,0.042874515,-0.019346802,-0.00878895,0.0119706,0.019585924,-0.045471434,0.011520362,-0.055952877,0.030012697,-0.029231945,-0.027480284,-0.011887888,-0.02