98694,0.025063979,0.020131504,0.027256904,0.0023635265,-0.06322436,0.00057020056,0.0010530134,0.0009595344,0.008513269,-0.023898907,0.019983122,-0.0022560626,-0.00034789124,-0.04148144,0.016339341,0.037071757,-0.013918833,0.011626373,-0.006628709,-0.0075987736,-0.079581946,-0.043907065,-0.018645199,0.016262649,0.00557488,0.015243163,-0.025567276,-0.014617699,-0.0034651768,0.00703368,-0.023871887,-0.027365869,0.031265847,-0.021277681,-0.039666362,0.03043258,-0.02804532,0.028237235,-0.02149422,0.011178506,0.15354119,0.034896404,0.011634948,-0.08111285,0.009772428,0.02391183,0.011738746,-0.04087788,0.003160738,0.023787871],"hash":"d23d9e5e:1684","model":"nomic-embed-text:latest","archived":true},{"uri":"file:///f%3A/blackrockmu/.novamind/memory/session-log.md","text":"## 2026-11-16T20:25:40.184Z\n- **User:** mesm coisa e percebi uma inconsistencia no hwid verja que uma assimiu o hwid da outra rs...\n- **Outcome:** Boa notícia e má notícia: ## O que EU quebrei (já corrigido) O **\"HWID do PC\"** que aparecia na UI (`12BA1074-EC4F9BAF-00000000-15CB2020`) era uma **estimativa calculada em C#**, e ela estava **errada** — o cliente real usa `12BA1074-DE8E4EB3-BC5BDE2E-BFCE2022`. Tu copiou esse valor errado pro campo \"Forçar HWID\". Por que a estimativa não bate: 1. **o `Main.dll` que roda ≠ o do disco** (o launcher atualiza o cliente; as constantes do algoritmo mudam — no build em disco o `imul` é `0x51E98150`, o que roda é outro); 2. o cliente é 32-bit (WOW64) e enxerga `nProc`/grupo de processadores diferente do processo 64-bit da UI. **Corrigi**: apaguei `Services/ClientHwid.cs` e o preenchimento do campo. Agora o valor mostrado é **o que o cliente gerou**, reportado pelo byp (o `base0` já mostrava o correto ✔). Ou seja: cada instância passa a mostrar o **seu** HWID, sem \"assumir o do outro\". ## O que NÃO é mais culpa nossa O log mostra o patch funcionando (`checagem de instancia unica neutralizada em 0x6842E6B0`) e a 2ª instância **não se matou** (agora dura 25s em vez de 3s). A morte agora é do **servidor**: ``` 12:12:02 CONNECT to 145.239.149.84:45901 ← conectou no GS 12:12:02 [PROXY] Conectado ao servidor real ...:45901 ← nosso proxy chegou no GS real (nada do servidor, nada do cliente: sem HWID, sem pacote de login) 12:12:27 Detached → \"You are disconnected from the server\" ``` Comparando com a instância que **funciona**: ela recebe do GS um **greeting de 12 bytes (`C1 0C F1 ...`) 1s a…\n- **Tools:** read_file, search_files, edit_file, run_command, repl, memory, manage_todos","vector":[0.042438075,0.049085278,-0.16684923,-0.018489085,0.036141235,-0.020895507,0.03635755,0.02304022,-0.06768159,-0.021766033,-0.010247441,0.007880415,0.026251502,-0.00614755,0.0650259,-0.012628045,-0.029251399,-0.043804143,-0.07725862,0.05054206,-0.0044385893,-0.036276568,-0.06260156,-0.0013379125,0.087062925,0.053462792,-0.0035348006,0.05302185,-0.016419336,0.014102411,0.0041128797,0.045353167,0.03570373,-0.030984884,-0.008297072,-0.014076521,0.041952092,-0.02627624,0.0077537876,0.02266435,-0.00472926,-0.09045702,0.014702017,-0.026308496,0.04149298,0.05496888,0.034053568,0.040261824,0.07024969,-0.06976175,0.04417412,-0.005257795,0.042636443,-0.04102453,0.08266608,0.01426726,-0.030964782,0.010708034,0.03617235,-0.056571025,0.093170315,0.06567722,-0.010533399,0.07785738,-0.03988451,-0.0018665267,-0.060066037,0.027057657,-0.020780029,-0.026803302,0.07582381,0.0056653745,0.047051925,0.012930381,-0.03877042,-0.010629004,-0.022703368,-0.043578546,-0.021718735,-0.011566543,0.023022402,0.026925687,0.089913,-0.038982708,0.051900297,0.055467542,-0.01207936,0.011117567,-0.024438435,0.049384844,-0.022973323,-0.031391963,0.018779796,0.001624909,-0.058581382,-0.021421768,-0.07495728,0.01845975,-0.026501127,-0.020617872,-0.002063064,-0.049326397,0.02756589,-0.037728064,0.03216867,0.063684955,-0.025515875,0.011709436,-0.0018943679,-0.033882868,-0.005454237,0.013567818,-0.018605482,-0.03159387,0.039996445,0.0014630017,0.026152216,-0.015407159,-0.022969445,0.01