,0.0029205382,-0.074221775,-0.050563227,0.029564451,-0.007453446,0.00022640514,-0.013928475,-0.014333701,-0.018340625,0.026263036,-0.04568816,-0.015430374,0.019065585,0.015258266,-0.022272736,-0.03930127,0.023594724,-0.0423686,-0.034959,-0.022500755,0.037563205,-0.02422251,0.015790466,-0.016200073,0.004343306,-0.02607721,0.00019816568,0.010056803,-0.003265439,0.018189585,-0.011181463,-0.02066264,0.026738288,-0.0047624446,-0.0075556044,-0.0093571665,-0.008066617,0.1359377,0.014804973,-0.022933163,-0.0529567,0.013265918,-0.0014080686,-0.037816126,-0.066023864,-0.0013933352,0.044776373],"hash":"104bc03e:1777","model":"nomic-embed-text:latest","archived":true},{"uri":"file:///f%3A/blackrockmu/.novamind/memory/session-log.md","text":"## 2026-11-16T21:20:32.530Z\n- **User:** remova o hwid ja que nao existe em adicional o que foi feito ainda nao funcionou... tomando dc ainda. no segundo cliente...\n- **Outcome:** ## Agora tenho a PROVA (no log do MuProxy2, build novo) ``` 13:15:15.418 [PROXY] GS: listener criado 127.0.0.1:46001 -> 145.239.149.84:45901 13:15:15.655 [PROXY] Conectado ao servidor real 145.239.149.84:45901 (saida 192.168.71.128:51609) 13:15:15.888 [PROXY] Relay 46001:S->C: socket encerrado pelo servidor -> \"An existing connection was forcibly closed by the remote host.\" ← RST ``` **O servidor aceitou o TCP e resetou a conexão 233 ms depois, sem mandar o greeting.** E **25 segundos antes**, no **mesmo IP público**, a base 0 recebeu o greeting normalmente: ``` 13:14:50 CONNECT to 145.239.149.84:45901 → connect local ret=0 err=0 13:14:51 recv() ret=12 → C1 0C F1 00 01 33 48 33 31 2E 00 00 ← greeting ✓ 13:14:52 [HWID] cliente gerou o HWID: 12BA1074-DE8E4EB3-BC5BDE2E-BFCE2022 13:14:52 SEND C3 134 (login) ✓ ``` **E o mais importante: o cliente já estava 100% transparente** (o hook de `getpeername` mascarando o peer para `145.239.149.84:45901` ✓ — aparece no log) — **e ainda assim o GS resetou**. Ou seja: **não era validação local do cliente** (minha hipótese anterior), é o **servidor** recusando a 2ª sessão daquele IP. No código do eMU isso só pode ser o `ServerAcceptCondition` → `CheckIpAddress` → **`MaxIpConnection`** (`CF_REJECT` → `closesocket` → RST). **Sobre teu \"outro PC com mais de 1 main no mesmo IP que não deu pau\":** o contador é **por IP público e é global** — soma o PC principal **e** a VM (ambos saem como `186.235.202.26`, o host faz NAT da VM). No teu teste de ag…\n- **Tools:** search_files, read_file, edit_file, run_command, manage_todos","vector":[-0.0028867417,0.039993234,-0.16268341,-0.022016235,0.034426607,-0.026468897,0.053115595,0.029474936,-0.043844335,-0.030868018,-0.03295682,0.018387713,0.022890987,-0.049875677,0.03810111,-0.018534144,0.004750337,-0.046846285,-0.07103256,0.02836774,-0.014035881,-0.058930434,-0.034586538,0.031009233,0.06768181,0.068310626,0.010886942,0.054703318,-0.023904461,-0.018896936,-0.012615525,0.0252263,0.014629468,-0.034936193,0.005910267,0.008203018,0.038578518,-0.024003098,-0.04042795,0.018433215,0.0230512,-0.0782343,0.027812535,-0.028867245,0.019965539,0.00067435397,0.011198875,0.038196087,0.057165455,-0.07363032,0.03849138,0.019366706,-0.018826915,-0.055311076,0.08046053,-0.017583145,-0.04279751,0.043931574,0.0010036182,-0.02139921,0.0699693,0.043497346,0.033526838,0.055812605,-0.0048948578,-0.009887629,-0.06375359,0.0204701,-0.0045499797,0.0116675645,0.048911694,0.010735915,0.03162687,-0.025204517,0.008423338,0.007703696,-0.032167222,-0.07258913,-0.0138623165,-0.01945526,0.03134999,-0.0075961594,0.096651964,-0.054358244,0.052648254,0.015016441,-0.04208809,0.0044073174,-0.05505017,0.07546203,0.011490141,-0.041739948,0.006011979,-0.019821275,-0.034273654,0.014245939,-0.08996593,0.0016040647,-0.034143496,-0.004540738,-0.002672008,-0.0369822,0.015383591,-0.038733643,0.012469904,0.071173266,-0.020165315,0.014584842,0.017758539,-0.018222261,-0.018106017,0.042887267,-0.036108464,-0.025360977,0.07215675,-0.022916904,0.028189516,-0.018194849,-0.0067182067,0.057337124,-0.05855378