0.020838512,-0.050006434,0.05686775,-0.009510131,0.024512392,0.02995675,0.041215606,0.09438166,0.0012609505,-0.007979729,-0.05852552,0.032329727,0.032732844,0.01390122,-0.039620914,0.016732128,0.022238318],"hash":"f9c6ff2d:1616","model":"nomic-embed-text:latest","archived":true},{"uri":"file:///f%3A/blackrockmu/.novamind/memory/session-log.md","text":"## 2026-11-16T21:47:44.490Z\n- **User:** na realidade quero que vc faca nop nessa verificacao para que ela seja como se aprovace... remova tudo que for mencao de hwid e ip de saida que vc fez... nao deve verifiucar mais essa regra no main.exe sacou?\n- **Outcome:** Feito. Resumo do que mudei e do que descobri no caminho: ## 1) NOP da verificação no main.exe (byp.dll) Primeiro correção de rumo: os endereços que eu te passei na mensagem anterior (`0x414C1B`, `0x414D0D`…) eram **absolutos** (base `0x400000`). Em RVA, a rotina fica em **main.exe+0x14BE0** e o gate em **main.exe+0x14D0D**. (O main.exe em disco é VMProtect — `.text` com raw size 0 — então li a memória do processo rodando via `ReadProcessMemory` + capstone.) O gate é este (14 bytes, verificados byte a byte): ```asm 0x414D07: mov ecx, [ebp-0x10B0] ; this 0x414D0D: cmp dword [ecx+0x30A4], 0 ; lista de salas existe? 0x414D14: jne 0x414D1B ; -> aprovado 0x414D16: jmp 0x414FE7 ; -> desiste (não envia C1 06 F4 -> dc) ``` Patch novo em `byp/gg_bypass2/src/client/ClientPatches.cpp:177` (`ClientPatches::ApplyRoomGate`): acha o gate pelo **padrão** (único no `.text` em runtime: `8B 8D 50 EF FF FF | 83 B9 A4 30 00 00 00 | 75 05 | E9`), valida o destino do `jmp` dentro da imagem do módulo e troca os 14 bytes por NOP → **o cliente sempre segue pelo caminho \"aprovado\"**. Chamado em `byp/gg_bypass2/src/core/dllmain.cpp:184` com retentativa por 10 s (o `.text` é descompactado pelo protetor). Correção extra do que eu te disse: `0x404AD0` **não é strcmp** — é `Room::IsSelected()` (lê o byte `[this+0xAA]`); `0x404900` é `Room::SetSelected(bool)` (escreve `[this+0xAB]`). ## 2) Removido HWID e \"Saída (IP)\" - **byp**: apagados `src/hwid/HwidManager.cpp`, `src/hwid/HwidAsm.asm`, `include/HwidManager…\n- **Tools:** skill, glob, read_file, search_files, mcp_tool, manage_todos, write_file, edit_file, run_command","vector":[0.0921706,0.041925084,-0.15941161,-0.050581202,0.05391003,-0.10015788,0.047783326,0.02480337,-0.026842512,-0.015108702,-0.030829092,0.008892676,0.026573982,0.017096171,-0.004146402,-0.0034980092,-0.03344157,-0.070673406,-0.060312953,0.002747039,-0.00042205083,-0.068437845,-0.050888956,-0.013351526,0.08570735,-0.0060169236,-0.0062495926,0.02103561,-0.026329549,-0.0063709673,0.03889957,0.015699951,0.04828799,-0.057002462,0.010258756,-0.009801265,0.034779366,0.0030932329,0.022987438,0.015056169,-0.006987487,-0.03825967,0.006292209,0.01030204,-0.017207703,0.06519295,0.016083285,0.007377874,0.06786498,-0.07282994,0.041107755,0.024883186,-0.0069087385,-0.052430023,0.11460146,0.015275762,-0.07172295,0.07226456,0.015045931,-0.027321836,0.063136235,0.04303781,-0.0047272746,0.09579784,0.020840228,-0.0126106655,-0.06323555,0.012150782,-0.013944958,-0.0058955415,0.02170893,-0.030769482,0.0007533836,0.0040729647,-0.014363733,-0.02552388,-0.025716288,-0.027249182,-0.0039018076,0.032253183,0.012142048,-0.013334262,0.095643386,-0.02200575,0.04595306,-0.021892542,-0.03686755,0.021902183,-0.031469434,0.06761683,-0.015567849,-0.017099582,0.029212575,-0.004073466,-0.054817453,0.020834249,-0.05886017,0.01037442,-0.009132452,-0.009674651,-0.024800185,0.004023735,0.04379035,-0.03142608,-0.0035914462,0.06725724,0.01094808,0.018871102,0.020420088,-0.026696471,-0.03512453,0.007010442,-0.020932008,-0.022163656,0.00392272,-0.029925866,0.032760054,-0.024953712,0.008988718,0.06256495,-0.036419213,-0.03864703,-0.018545609,0.06119271,0.054032765,-0.012920097,-0.032953322,-0.0074056787,0.026557883,-0.060569566,0.012085508,-0.0462147,-0.05498723,0.024027135,0.062001698,0.023369508,0.0069215214,-0.009456456,0.014565821,0.01850975,-0.0044814562,0.014664563,-