mic-embed-text:latest","archived":true},{"uri":"file:///f%3A/blackrockmu/.novamind/memory/session-log.md","text":"## 2026-11-16T22:23:48.175Z\n- **User:** Qual IP o GS enxerga Em SocketManager.cpp:717 ele pega o endereço do WSAAccept (inet_ntoa(SocketAddr->sin_addr)) e passa para o gIpManager. Jogador vindo pela internet: é o IP público do roteador dele. Jogador na mesma rede do servidor: é o IP de LAN (192.168.x.x). Cliente rodando na própria máquina do servidor: 127.0.0.1 ou o IP local.\n- **Outcome:** Confirmei no código-fonte do MuEmu. Resposta curta: **o GS enxerga o IP público do PC que roda o MuProxy2 — `186.235.202.26` (o NAT do seu roteador) — e NÃO o loopback.** As duas instâncias chegam com exatamente o mesmo IP. ## Por quê (caminho do socket) | Etapa | Onde | Quem abre o socket | |---|---|---| | Cliente → destino real | `byp/gg_bypass2/src/net/winsock/WinsockHooks.cpp:376-378` | o byp reescreve o destino para `127.0.0.X` (porta intacta) | | Loopback → servidor real | `byp/MuProxy2/MuProxy2/TcpLoopbackProxy.cs:219-222` | **o MuProxy2 (C#) abre o socket de saída** | `server.ConnectAsync(_realHost, _realPort)` sai do seu PC. Logo, no `WSAAccept` (`MuEmu-master/eMU/GameServer/GameServer/SocketManager.cpp:734`), o `inet_ntoa(SocketAddr->sin_addr)` da linha 717 devolve o IP público do roteador: **186.235.202.26** (confirmei via ipify — o CS em `54.36.205.234:44411` e o GS em `145.239.149.84:45901` veem o mesmo). ## O que o GS faz com esse IP (e por que deu RST) `SocketManager.cpp:719` → `gIpManager.CheckIpAddress(peerIP)`: ```cpp // MuEmu-master/eMU/GameServer/GameServer/IpManager.cpp:34 return ((it->second.IpAddressCount >= gServerInfo.m_MaxIpConnection) ? 0 : 1); ``` O contador é incrementado em `gObjAdd` (`User.cpp:1167`) e decrementado em `gObjDel` (`User.cpp:1211`) — ou seja, é o número de sockets vivos daquele IP. Com a sessão base 0 logada, `186.235.202.26` já está com count=1 → se `MaxIpConnection=1`, a segunda conexão é **CF_REJECT** → `WSAAccept` falha → socke…\n- **Tools:** glob, search_files, read_file, tool_search, web_fetch","vector":[0.020124353,0.086614124,-0.15527138,-0.032224122,0.016189912,-0.05879554,0.041279525,-0.002775475,-0.050626066,0.0018101104,-0.0005641923,0.026971031,0.02061996,-0.04354483,0.03166701,-0.03313343,-0.0077133626,-0.010289969,-0.016128523,-0.012011185,0.008121648,-0.081690446,-0.007510984,-0.018321073,0.08816547,0.04252375,-0.00034327072,0.03272456,-0.009766658,0.0012792932,0.023463793,0.00068669836,-0.0003529211,-0.036746927,-0.049522076,-0.0077486904,0.02227401,-0.05125725,0.0023662138,0.0072782147,-0.0017457111,-0.08078917,0.00034238872,-0.005868266,0.018885458,0.002861363,0.028963009,0.044046197,0.06729959,-0.112751156,-0.009156912,0.024393905,0.0069857365,-0.030507572,0.071165904,0.034319468,-0.005932471,0.047247235,0.04075852,-0.037583616,0.056678023,0.042014845,0.0027859493,0.049513374,-0.005723805,-0.0035041033,-0.054197125,0.043402966,-0.011231768,0.0101500815,0.01157558,-0.0135993,0.08256614,-0.014463628,0.056352567,-0.003350959,-0.035742957,-0.04963194,0.017195543,0.01836639,0.030111345,-0.0106965285,0.084357314,-0.062282838,0.009669453,-0.0058698365,-0.036153674,0.014027244,-0.031385057,0.08332079,0.030472916,0.00867814,0.04370021,0.02019621,-0.07184493,0.03194687,-0.034790922,0.017499564,-0.030563898,0.0040390766,-0.0014415041,-0.014988555,0.04573841,-0.034842223,0.009603699,0.09460679,0.0036868644,0.012110001,0.00020942657,-0.0020688104,0.015355606,0.028611135,-0.008888363,-0.035382338,0.01650923,-0.003764337,0.0363177,-0.0502408,0.029527234,0.03931925,-0.048152972,-0.014772974,-0.03124063,0.07343788,0.06813446,-0.005002978,-0.024839807,0.019443488,0.026360877,-0.0584679,0.0020615275,-0.02754675,-0.07428055,0.031622157,0.028694544,0.01973019,0.007623369,-0.013620615,0.07737499,0.002505539,0.014519881,-0.012811863,0.02376874,-0.042049658,0.06632601,-0.020885065,0.031033827,-0.045631163,-0.029374637,0.013336004,0.034354035,-0.00893977,0.021241779,0.060897227,0.0464729