file:///f%3A/blackrockmu/.novamind/memory/session-log.md","text":"## 2026-11-16T23:03:24.139Z\n- **User:** Isso muda o diagnóstico: cair ao clicar na sala é o GS recusando a conexão, e a causa mais provável é o `MaxIpConnection`. Não consegui confirmar o valor, porque o arquivo de configuração do GS (o `.dat` do MuServer) não está neste repositório. **O que acontece ao clicar na sala** - Até a lista de salas, o cliente só fala com o ConnectServer. Ao clicar, ele abre uma conexão nova com o GameServer. - O GS decide se aceita em [SocketManager.cpp:715](eMU/GameServer/GameServer/SocketManager.cpp:715):…\n- **Outcome:** O texto colado conflita com o que medimos. Vou separar as **duas** falhas distintas que aparecem nos logs, porque elas têm causas diferentes. ## O greeting de 12 bytes é a prova de que o GS ACEITOU O pacote `[C1 0C F1 00 01 <idxHi> <idxLo> 33 31 2E 00 00]` é o `GCConnectClientSend` (`Protocol.cpp:2941-2950`) — e ele é enviado em `SocketManager.cpp:811`, **depois** de `gObjAdd` (`:763`). Logo, quando o cliente recebe esse pacote: - o `WSAAccept` **passou** (não foi `CF_REJECT`); - `gObjAddSearch` + `gObjAdd` rodaram → **o objeto existe no servidor** e o IP foi registrado no `gIpManager`; - o servidor **atribuiu o slot** de jogador (0x332D / 0x32DB / 0x33DB). E o base100 **recebeu o greeting** em 14:25:14, 14:25:50 e 14:54:35 — **com a base 0 logada ao mesmo tempo**. Se o `MaxIpConnection` fosse 1, o accept seria rejeitado e o cliente nunca veria esses 12 bytes. Então **o `MaxIpConnection` não é o que está barrando agora**. ## O que barrou foi a CONTA Depois do greeting, o login foi recusado — e o código do resultado está no log: ``` 14:25:14 recv ret=12 → [C1 0C F1 00 01 33 2D 33 31 2E 00 00] ← GS aceitou, slot 0x332D 14:25:16 SEND [C1 5F F1 ...] ← login enviado 14:25:17 recv ret=5 → [C1 05 F1 01 02] ← AccountInvalid 14:25:21 recv ret=5 → [C1 05 F1 01 07] ← ConnectionError 14:25:30 recv ret=5 → [C1 05 F1 01 08] ← 3ª tentativa → fecha ``` `C1 05 F1 01 <LoginResult>` é o `GCConnectAccountSend` (`Protocol.cpp:2968-2988`); a tabela de códigos está em `OpenMU-master/docs/Packets/C1…\n- **Tools:** search_files, read_file, run_command, desktop_list_windows, desktop_snapshot","vector":[0.02869871,0.09299714,-0.123596855,-0.06446844,0.04477722,-0.064664595,0.037060577,0.004147287,-0.056038678,-0.028332647,-0.027196338,-0.0020977664,0.052920606,-0.024199871,0.05061162,-0.034414265,-0.015755426,-0.014660974,-0.06544926,0.020288212,0.013540014,-0.051483184,-0.014410611,-0.0047770464,0.06774337,0.059152722,-0.013642661,0.07759119,-0.044106178,-0.0061743413,0.04596862,0.04184494,0.014465451,-0.0471956,-0.027915351,-0.03174325,0.016379675,-0.049601287,-0.013244347,0.030611714,0.012133378,-0.06790931,0.023072328,-0.049106028,0.014789264,-0.002039075,0.05959717,0.063576795,0.062485065,-0.11016968,0.018151201,0.028309839,0.019518126,-0.029512795,0.08775255,0.03107624,-0.013338219,0.034614813,0.037783347,-0.06339825,0.105788834,0.035629865,0.010903343,0.07997719,0.01440122,-0.018382125,-0.041241728,0.018878313,-0.030327516,0.026817137,0.038763244,-0.0432171,0.060220037,-0.0030727806,0.03986342,-0.0130546335,-0.0610866,-0.044874005,-0.0032106296,-0.012172626,0.027730076,0.00867132,0.09549747,-0.07512386,0.01583273,0.0069251675,-0.037626848,-0.0069105243,-0.035167076,0.05556756,0.004130041,-0.03624394,0.038624134,-0.003454029,-0.05914713,0.011149939,-0.0238833,-0.008002579,-0.033886548,-0.0019136281,-0.023653653,-0.013223226,0.04287947,-0.041354384,0.022536483,0.08669115,-0.023970703,0.022047393,-0.0035567738,-0.0121090785,0.0019092022,0.051272646,-0.01426607,-0.044491675,0.04600854,0.000044314034,0.035823956,-0.03821105,0.012551307,0.021223519,-0.024352092,-0.020817243,-0.038110584,0.04787061,0.05663517,0.026032472,-0.00071874075,0.009215096,0.04514928,-0.05797546,-0.008420073,0.0015915493,-0.05496063,0.040162012,0.02153261,0.013645511,-0.0028502976,-0.02416172,0.07389582,0.017565187,0.0023470279,-0.012507628,-0.0015831806,-0.02595408