20:46 → 14:20:53:** ``` SEND C1 04 F4 06 → pede a lista de salas ao CS SEND C1 04 F4 06 SEND C1 06 F4 03 00 00 → seleciona a sala 3 recv 22 → F4 03 \"145.239.149.84\" C116: porta do GS = 45901 CONNECT 45901 → recv 12 → [C1 0C F1 00 01 33 28 33 31 2E 00 00] (greeting, slot 0x3328) SEND C1 5F F1 → login recv 5 → [C1 05 F1 01 01] ← OK, entra no jogo ``` **base 100 (falha), 14:07:41 → 14:07:46:** ``` SEND C1 04 F4 06 SEND C1 04 F4 06 SEND C1 06 F4 03 00 00 ← byte-idêntico recv 22 → F4 C116: porta do GS = 45901 CONNECT 45901 → (não chega nada) ``` **base 100 (falha, com greeting), 14:25:14 → 14:25:30:** ``` CONNECT 45901 → recv 12 → [C1 0C F1 00 01 33 2D 33 31 2E 00 00] (greeting, slot 0x332D) SEND C1 5F F1 → recv 5 → [C1 05 F1 01 02] SEND C1 5F F1 → recv 5 → [C1 05 F1 01 07] SEND C1 5F F1 → recv 5 → [C1 05 F1 01 08] ``` Até a conexão com o G…\n- **Tools:** search_files, run_command","vector":[0.070742786,0.04849551,-0.16897908,-0.02585826,0.055413734,-0.08625313,0.039474707,-0.017521901,-0.043419026,-0.006989565,-0.06415231,0.017143587,0.013517954,0.01321113,0.030178104,-0.017831367,0.022547716,-0.04646189,-0.0739183,0.00042817538,0.04108435,-0.022599187,-0.024097972,0.0010674866,0.07820293,0.039238945,0.007589296,0.05053797,-0.033088107,0.012585981,0.053650565,0.026357474,0.029318059,-0.054350432,0.0038129096,-0.065746926,0.05285853,-0.0027105329,0.0077789896,0.042227574,0.021178124,-0.08246991,-0.01105347,0.00016012184,-0.0076139695,0.02198039,0.032811623,-0.0018064257,0.05008566,-0.077768534,0.014995579,0.036291197,-0.00039804087,-0.012033196,0.07113307,0.03715289,-0.06992381,0.028532716,0.048089083,0.010157939,0.0737269,0.024353748,0.0021704847,0.10773121,0.021956943,-0.009878258,-0.04705549,0.03682037,-0.012926495,-0.029348506,0.030320099,-0.010953134,0.029510876,0.0021550986,-0.0014815213,-0.024794318,-0.030627826,-0.035878778,-0.027371991,0.008578555,-0.009589687,-0.019063104,0.10150032,-0.057372127,0.048744556,-0.046217646,0.0014297066,-0.007587811,-0.033001814,